        "y0": 0.665621232279622,
        "x1": 0.40177405060743326,
        "y1": 0.6798743679694738
      },
      "text": "d'origine accidentelle ou illicite.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09514233810177719,
        "y0": 0.6860032206658219,
        "x1": 0.9129227997914986,
        "y1": 0.7002563563556736
      },
      "text": "Dans les meilleurs délais, et au plus tard dans les 48 heures après en avoir eu connaissance, le",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09514233810177719,
        "y0": 0.7003988819129564,
        "x1": 0.9125178262189871,
        "y1": 0.7146520176028082
      },
      "text": "contractant notifie au responsable du traitement les violations pertinentes de données à caractère",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
